{"content":[{"c":["KING’S GARDEN"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Probably an area of the royal estates, situated outside the walls of Jerusalem near the pool of Siloam (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.25.4","r":"2Kgs.25.4","rawR":"2Kgs.25.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.25.4","value":"2Kgs.25.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 25:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.39.4","r":"Jer.39.4","rawR":"Jer.39.4","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.39.4","value":"Jer.39.4"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 39:4"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.52.7","r":"Jer.52.7","rawR":"Jer.52.7","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.52.7","value":"Jer.52.7"}],"t":"ref","v":"52:7"},") in the Kidron Valley, near where the Kidron meets the valley of Hinnom. Upon the return from the exile, Nehemiah set the families to work, each building a part of the wall. Fountain Gate is recorded as being near the pool of Siloam by the king’s garden (",{"href":"?bref=Neh.3.15","r":"Neh.3.15","rawR":"Neh.3.15","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Neh.3.15","value":"Neh.3.15"}],"t":"ref","v":"Neh 3:15"},"). It is not certain whether the site now called the king’s garden outside the walls of modern Jerusalem is the original site."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"KingsGarden","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"2 Kgs 25:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=2Kgs.25.4","rawQueryValue":"2Kgs.25.4","sourceRefExact":"2Kgs.25.4"},{"anchorText":"Jer 39:4","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.39.4","rawQueryValue":"Jer.39.4","sourceRefExact":"Jer.39.4"},{"anchorText":"52:7","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Jer.52.7","rawQueryValue":"Jer.52.7","sourceRefExact":"Jer.52.7"},{"anchorText":"Neh 3:15","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Neh.3.15","rawQueryValue":"Neh.3.15","sourceRefExact":"Neh.3.15"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"7f0a9aa04b53755bac56bc039464968f2b9e57396f4b8d4b5cd53635f56a6fa8","sourceItemName":"KingsGarden","sourceItemOrder":85,"sourceMember":"Articles/K.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"KingsGarden","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"King’s Garden","title":"King’s Garden","version":"v2-a101d843a2f0cd3fc0c6"}